                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This repository contains the full text format and the annotations for the Dutch Stance Twitter (DuST) dataset. The dataset is part of larger annotation initiative, the Dynamic Stance Corpus (DySC), a multi-lingual, and multi-topic corpus in Catalan and Dutch to model dynamic stance in online interactions in social media platforms.\n<br><br>\nFull description of the dataset, including the publicly distributable format, is available at <a href=\"https://github.com/projecte-aina/dynamic-stance-analysis\">https://github.com/projecte-aina/dynamic-stance-analysis</a>"
